## Why This Is Asked
This tests practical data contracts, per-tenant isolation, and drift handling in a real-world ingestion pipeline.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant data contracts in Data Catalog
- Streaming validation with Dataflow
- Schema drift observability and drift ledger
- Rollback window and controlled replay
- Cost controls via partitioning, quotas, and monitoring

## Code Example
